{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43315","headline":"禁中春松 · 员南溟","name":"禁中春松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郁郁贞松树，阴阴在紫宸。\n葱茏偏近日，青翠更宜春。\n雅韵风来起，轻烟霁後新。\n叶深栖语鹤，枝亚拂朝臣。\n全节长依地，凌云欲致身。\n山苗荫不得，生植荷陶钧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"员南溟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43315.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43315","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}